Please note: The application deadline is January 19, 2027, at 11:59 p.m. ET. &nbsp;

The Summer Internship Program: &nbsp;

Ready to gain hands-on experience working with live client briefs and contribute to work that makes a cultural impact? Our Summer Internship is the place for you. For 10 weeks, from June to August, interns jump right into the action, contributing to current campaigns and fast-moving projects alongside our award-winning creative teams. Interns gain wide exposure to different brands and creative leaders, with dedicated mentorship to sharpen their craft and gain the real-world experience that makes a portfolio shine.&nbsp; &nbsp;

The Roles &amp; W hat We're Looking For : &nbsp;

We’re not just interested in what you’ve done, but how you think. To be considered for a creative role, your application must include a link to a portfolio or sample of work - show us your creative process and unique point of view. &nbsp;

We are looking for interns in the following creative roles within The Ogilvy Group, including Ogilvy, Ogilvy Health and Grey : &nbsp;

• Art Director: You think BIG, translating ideas simply for impactful solutions across various platforms. You're a team player with a strong visual sensibility and craft. &nbsp;

• Copywriter: You write and read a lot, understanding big conceptual ideas and the nuance of execution across diverse categories. &nbsp;

• Designer: You 'geek out' on design principles, techniques, and trends, applying a logical, analytical, and empathetic approach to solve human problems. &nbsp;

Please note:&nbsp; This application is specifically for creative craft internships. A separate application exists for other general business and strategy roles and can be found on our careers page. &nbsp;

